Inside this repository 
action NOW () - instructions for task to be executed 
Action DONE () - past instructions for tasks performed 

Directory structure () - defines the directory structure and files inside this repository 

Inside <directory_name> in <file_name> - tells which file inside which repository to perform the action
------------------------------------------------------

Directory structure (
Skillflow/
├── index.html                # Main application dashboard, roadmap, and daily schedule views
├── auth.html                 # Mandatory authentication entry and login interface
├── agy.info                  # Repository workflow documentation and task tracking
├── README.md                 # Project description, guidelines, and overview
├── LICENSE                   # Open-source license
├── css/
│   ├── styles.css            # Main application styles, design tokens, tab switcher utilities
│   └── auth.css              # Authentication split-screen layout and visual styling
├── js/
│   ├── app.js                # App bootstrap, auth guard, view switcher orchestration
│   ├── auth.js               # Authentication form validation, session storage, redirects
│   ├── onboarding.js         # Track selection, experience level, and budget configuration
│   ├── roadmap.js            # Learning path stage graph, prerequisite tracking, and rendering
│   ├── scheduler.js          # Deterministic task scheduling engine and adaptive rescheduling
│   └── storeage.js           # LocalStorage persistence utility helpers
├── data/
│   └── learning-paths.json   # Structured curriculum tracks (Frontend & Python Data Analysis)
├── backend/
│   ├── login.cpp             # User verification, local database authentication, and signup popup triggers
│   └── signup.cpp            # Signup handler taking <name>.json and storing as BSON in dbs/
└── dbs/
    ├── init_mongo.js         # Mongosh database initialization script for collections and indexes
    └── users.json            # Local user credentials datastore for verification
)

